&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gram Games is the studio behind popular titles like 1010!, Six!, Merge Dragons!, and Merge Magic!, with more exciting projects in the pipeline. We are proudly part of the Zynga &amp;amp; Take-Two Interactive family. We do things differently here: we work in small self-managing teams, giving you an incredible amount of ownership, autonomy, and impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Gram, everyone is expected to have a razor-sharp focus on creating a tangible impact on their team, their work environment, and on the overall company strategy. If you are motivated by autonomy, constant improvement, collaboration, and a sense of belonging, this is the place for you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are looking for a results-driven UA leader to drive profitable growth for&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Gram Games and Merge Dragons!&lt;/strong&gt;. This role will own the full UA strategy and execution across all major channels, leading scale initiatives while improving efficiency, measurement, and cross-functional collaboration.&amp;nbsp;You will work closely with Product, Creative, ASO, and Data teams to unlock sustainable growth, strengthen funnel performance, and continuously identify new opportunities. You will mentor and empower the UA team to deliver best-in-class execution with strong accountability on performance outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Own the end-to-end UA strategy and performance for the portfolio, ensuring profitability targets are met.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Manage yearly growth planning, scaling strategies, and risk-mitigation across markets and channels.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Drive strategic experimentation and support innovation in targeting, channels, and inventory diversification.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead measurement frameworks (MMM, incrementality studies, pLTV) to improve decision quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strengthen full-funnel performance with product-aligned campaigns (FTUE/RTUE, monetization events).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Build rigorous test roadmaps in creative, audiences, and campaign structure to drive ROAS and LTV uplift.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team &amp;amp; Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Mentor UA managers and analysts; help build structured career growth and execution excellence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner closely with Creative teams to fuel testing velocity and creative breakthroughs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with ASO and Product teams to ensure cohesive funnel optimization and visibility improvements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Establish clear accountability for results with transparent reporting and actionable insights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Improve execution speed through better process, prioritization, and cross-team alignment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;6–10+ years of performance marketing experience in mobile free-to-play, ideally in gaming.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proven track record of scaling multi-million €/$ UA budgets profitably.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong fluency in mobile attribution, LTV modeling, and ROAS optimization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience leading and developing high-performing teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong analytical thinking and decision-making using data and experimentation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to influence stakeholders and drive alignment across multiple functions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Bonus: familiarity with Match-3/puzzle models and Merge Games or builder games.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In return for bringing your expertise to this top-priority role, we offer some of the best benefits in the gaming industry!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Highly competitive salary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Private medical care&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Company bonus scheme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Relocation assistance for those moving to the UK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Awesome onsite chef serving breakfast, lunch, and lots of treats (naughty and nice)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Life insurance and a favorable pension scheme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Healthcare cash plan, including dental and optical coverage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Amazing tech to work with and consoles to play and relax with everywhere you look!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer, which means we are committed to creating and celebrating diverse thoughts, cultures, and backgrounds throughout our organization.&amp;nbsp; Employment with us is based on substantive ability, objective qualifications, and work ethic – not an individual’s race, creed, color, religion, sex or gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin or ancestry, alienage or citizenship status, physical or mental disability, pregnancy, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, status as a victim of domestic violence or sex offenses, reproductive health decision, or any other characteristics protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an equal opportunity employer, we are committed to providing the necessary support and accommodation to qualified individuals with disabilities, health conditions, or impairments (subject to any local qualifying requirements) to ensure their full participation in the job application or interview process. Please contact us at &lt;a ---------- to request any accommodations or for support related to your application for an open position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware that Zynga does not conduct job interviews or make job offers over third-party messaging apps such as Telegram, WhatsApp, or others.&amp;nbsp; Zynga also does not engage in any financial exchanges during the recruitment or onboarding process, and will never ask a candidate for their personal or financial information over an app or other unofficial chat channel.&amp;nbsp; Any attempt to do so may be the result of a scamp or phishing attack, and you should not engage.&amp;nbsp; Zynga’s&amp;nbsp; in-house recruitment team will only contact individuals through their official Company email addresses (i.e., via a zynga.com, take2games.com, naturalmotion.com, smallgiantgames.com, themavens.com, gram.gs email domain).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Hybrid, Holborn Gate, London&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacancy Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent, full time &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to:&lt;/strong&gt; Head of Innovation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;About STEMAI&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;STEM AI is transforming how life sciences organisations access insights through AI-powered solutions. As our platform expands, we are looking for a Client Success Coordinator to ensure clients move seamlessly from pilot agreement through to successful implementation. This newly created role sits at the heart of the client journey, coordinating complex approval activities and working across technical, legal, commercial and operational teams to remove barriers and accelerate commissioning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Following agreement to pilot STEM AI, clients typically complete multiple internal approval processes covering information security, IT, legal, procurement, compliance, data privacy and operational readiness. Every organisation has different governance requirements, making this a highly collaborative role requiring excellent organisation and stakeholder management.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will become the central point of coordination, ensuring requests are managed efficiently, the right subject matter experts are engaged, responses are prepared to a high standard and clients receive a professional, responsive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate all client approval activities to drive pilot commitment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary point of contact throughout the implementation approval journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage questionnaires, security assessments and due diligence requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate responses from technical, legal, compliance, commercial and operational teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track milestones, manage deadlines and proactively resolve blockers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare high-quality responses using existing knowledge libraries and previous submissions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and continually improve the central repository of approved responses and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular progress updates to internal stakeholders and escalate risks where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to streamline approval activity processes and improve the client experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support successful pilot launches by ensuring approvals are completed accurately and on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;About You&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in client success, implementation, project coordination, PMO or programme management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organisational skills with the ability to manage multiple priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working with senior internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly collaborative with a proactive, solutions-focused mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within AI, healthcare or life sciences is advantageous but not essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Why Join STEMAI?&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to help shape a new AI offering from the ground up. You will play a pivotal role in creating a best-in-class client onboarding experience, working alongside innovation, technology and commercial teams to build scalable processes that directly contribute to faster implementations, improved client satisfaction and business growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inizio Ignite is the global advisory partner for health and life sciences, encompassing connected expertise across Research Partnership, Putnam, Vynamic, and STEM. Guided by purpose, passion, and precision, we collaborate with clients to ignite impact, accelerate performance, and deliver lasting change for patients. By uniting strategy, insights, and innovation with a unique depth and breadth of expertise, we drive transformation and shape the future of health. Our STEM team uses benchmarking through AI-enabled and evidence-based approaches to drive alignment resulting in accelerated performance. Serving clients across brand &amp;amp; commercial, Medical Affairs &amp;amp; sales, our expertise includes data, research &amp;amp; insights (proprietary benchmarking data), strategic brand alignment, and sales &amp;amp; MSL performance benchmarking. Proudly part of Inizio – the market-leading commercialization partner for health and life sciences. From early-stage development to loss of exclusivity, we simplify complexity, unlock value, and make collaboration seamless at every pivotal moment – supporting confident, insight-driven decisions that move innovation forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find us here:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Website: &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.inizio.com/ourbusinesses/ignite&quot;&gt;www.inizio.com/ourbusinesses/ignite&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;STEM Healthcare is an equal opportunity employer.&amp;nbsp; STEM Healthcare will consider all qualified applicants for employment without discrimination on grounds of disability, sex or sexual orientation, pregnancy or maternity leave status, race or national or ethnic origin, age, religion or belief, gender identity or re-assignment, marital or civil partnership status, protected veteran status (if applicable) or any other characteristic protected by law. STEM Healthcare only employs individuals with the right to work in the country/ies where the role is advertised.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don&#39;t meet every job requirement? That&#39;s okay! Our company is dedicated to building a diverse, inclusive, and authentic workplace. If you&#39;re excited about this role, but your experience doesn&#39;t perfectly fit every qualification, we encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right person for this role or others.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation and growth drive everything we do. Our Product team defines how millions of people experience Deliveroo, turning complex marketplace challenges into simple, high-impact solutions.&amp;nbsp;Working at the intersection of data, design and engineering, we set direction, prioritise what matters most, and deliver outcomes that move the business forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Product Designer (Retail)&lt;/strong&gt; to join our London team. This is a hybrid role. In this role, you’ll help us shape the strategic vision for retail delivery, building brand-new shopping experiences and unlocking emerging categories to scale our marketplace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;You’ll be joining the &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;22&quot;&gt;Retail&lt;/strong&gt; team. Retail is a fast-growing, greenfield area for us beyond core restaurant and grocery delivery, helping people get almost anything delivered locally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic Direction &amp;amp; Product Vision&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot;&gt;Lead strategic design sprints to establish the foundation and execution plan for our 2027 product vision, defining how distinct retail categories and shopping formats feel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot;&gt;Partner autonomously with Product, Engineering, and Business leaders as a trusted advisor to co-own the product roadmap and decide what we build and why.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Craft &amp;amp; Quality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot;&gt;Raise the design craft bar across the team by guiding team members, hosting critique sessions, and fostering a culture of high quality and detail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot;&gt;Spot and resolve platform-wide systems challenges—such as accessibility, performance, and UI consistency—at scale across the ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;14&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;15,0,0&quot;&gt;Drive studio-wide initiatives that shape overall design culture, recruitment practices, and the integration of AI into design workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;18,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;End-to-End Design Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ownership of complex, ambiguous product initiatives from greenfield ideas to launch within fast-paced tech environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;18,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to act as a strategic partner to senior leadership, shaping business strategy and navigating competing priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;18,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Developing Talent:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience coaching and mentoring designers to level up their craft while supporting autonomous growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;18,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Clear Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to articulate design rationale clearly to cross-functional stakeholders, from engineering leads to executive directors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;18,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technical Systems Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong understanding of how design decisions interact with code, systems architecture, and engineering constraints.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Solve meaningful problems at real scale&lt;/strong&gt; Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;See your impact, fast&lt;/strong&gt; Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Grow through challenge and ownership&lt;/strong&gt; Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;A culture built for builders&lt;/strong&gt; High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;​​💰 &lt;strong&gt;Share in the success you help create&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➡️ Want a deeper look at how we build? Check out our &lt;a class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://deliveroo.engineering&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Tech Blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
